WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.790
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:38.060 --> 01:43.990
[Small Town Remedy]

3
01:44.170 --> 01:46.870
[Episode 10]

4
01:50.350 --> 01:51.610
Our daughter, Ai Chen,

5
01:52.039 --> 01:53.920
has already taken a fancy to you.

6
01:55.000 --> 01:56.590
Why don't you

7
01:56.590 --> 01:57.710
like her?

8
02:23.190 --> 02:24.000
Kid.

9
02:26.470 --> 02:27.400
Our family

10
02:28.280 --> 02:30.400
is indeed no ordinary one.

11
02:31.710 --> 02:33.560
Dating Ai Chen

12
02:35.630 --> 02:37.520
comes with pressure for sure.

13
02:38.150 --> 02:39.870
But as a young man,

14
02:41.000 --> 02:43.660
you must have the courage to face difficulties.

15
02:44.079 --> 02:45.360
You can't let

16
02:46.560 --> 02:47.960
an "evil" father-in-law

17
02:49.000 --> 02:51.329
and an "unreasonable" mother-in-law...

18
02:56.079 --> 02:57.590
make you back down, huh?

19
02:59.310 --> 03:00.520
Our Ai Chen is

20
03:01.360 --> 03:04.190
fair-skinned and gorgeous, has long legs,

21
03:04.190 --> 03:06.590
makes good money, and cares for the family.

22
03:07.000 --> 03:08.520
How could you possibly not like her?

23
03:08.520 --> 03:10.050
It just doesn't make sense.

24
03:11.280 --> 03:12.360
Love

25
03:13.240 --> 03:14.400
makes people blind.

26
03:18.280 --> 03:20.610
You should calm down and think it through.

27
03:21.400 --> 03:23.630
Are you really not into her,

28
03:24.360 --> 03:26.220
or are you just too afraid to admit

29
03:26.910 --> 03:28.170
your feelings for her?

30
03:34.960 --> 03:35.690
Zhengliang.

31
03:37.710 --> 03:38.240
We're at work.

32
03:38.240 --> 03:39.700
Why are you chatting here?

33
03:40.190 --> 03:42.190
President Long wants to talk to you.

34
03:54.680 --> 03:55.910
Come on! What are you dawdling for?

35
03:55.910 --> 03:57.240
He's about to lose it.

36
04:09.430 --> 04:09.960
Go ahead.

37
04:30.360 --> 04:31.600
That's it?

38
04:31.600 --> 04:32.930
What else do you expect?

39
04:39.920 --> 04:40.510
Well...

40
04:41.240 --> 04:42.510
Where is President Long?

41
04:42.510 --> 04:43.750
Isn't he about to lose it?

42
04:43.750 --> 04:45.360
It's not about the President losing it.

43
04:45.360 --> 04:46.240
If we hadn't called you back,

44
04:46.240 --> 04:48.360
San and Si would have given you hell.

45
04:48.950 --> 04:50.720
One punch from San,

46
04:51.070 --> 04:52.870
and you'd probably be torn apart.

47
04:52.870 --> 04:53.310
Tell me,

48
04:53.310 --> 04:53.870
if I didn't help you

49
04:53.870 --> 04:55.040
make this narrow escape,

50
04:55.040 --> 04:56.040
who else could?

51
04:56.750 --> 04:58.070
How are you going to thank me?

52
04:58.070 --> 04:58.870
And us.

53
04:59.000 --> 05:00.260
Treat us to a meal, huh?

54
05:04.680 --> 05:05.280
Thank you.

55
05:10.800 --> 05:11.800
That's improvement.

56
05:11.800 --> 05:13.750
He's learned some manners and knows how to say thanks.

57
05:13.750 --> 05:14.800
He's just scared.

58
05:16.110 --> 05:19.570
[Fucheng North Station]

59
05:18.870 --> 05:20.920
Usually, I'm the one seeing others off.

60
05:20.920 --> 05:21.680
It's finally my turn

61
05:21.680 --> 05:22.740
to leave this time.

62
05:22.870 --> 05:24.730
You're getting quite emotional.

63
05:26.270 --> 05:28.730
Actually, you didn't have to come see me off.

64
05:29.190 --> 05:31.120
No matter how much we fight, we're still brothers.

65
05:31.120 --> 05:32.600
That's one in tens of thousands chance,

66
05:32.600 --> 05:33.240
remember?

67
05:36.480 --> 05:37.950
Hurry up. They're checking tickets.

68
05:37.950 --> 05:39.000
Don't drag your feet.

69
05:39.000 --> 05:40.630
Call me when you reach Beijing,

70
05:40.630 --> 05:41.390
got it?

71
05:41.630 --> 05:42.360
I'm leaving.

72
05:43.680 --> 05:45.740
H-Hurry... Go ahead. Stop dawdling.

73
05:57.040 --> 05:58.240
Well, then... Um...

74
06:03.000 --> 06:03.800
What's wrong?

75
06:04.240 --> 06:05.510
Do you have my ID card?

76
06:05.720 --> 06:07.120
How could I have it?

77
06:08.070 --> 06:09.160
-Chen... -Why are you looking at me?

78
06:09.160 --> 06:10.690
I definitely don't have it.

79
06:10.830 --> 06:12.070
I've still got work to do.

80
06:12.070 --> 06:12.830
I'm heading back.

81
06:12.830 --> 06:14.290
Take your time finding it.

82
06:16.920 --> 06:18.190
Oh no, my ID card is gone.

83
06:18.190 --> 06:18.920
Calm down.

84
06:18.920 --> 06:19.850
It can't be lost.

85
06:19.990 --> 06:22.190
Check your bag and suitcase carefully.

86
06:22.190 --> 06:23.510
If you really can't find it,

87
06:23.510 --> 06:24.120
just apply

88
06:24.120 --> 06:25.450
for a temporary ID card.

89
06:26.120 --> 06:28.050
There are even temporary ID cards?

90
06:35.560 --> 06:36.870
I got it, but the train has departed.

91
06:36.870 --> 06:37.560
What should I do now?

92
06:37.560 --> 06:39.560
It's fine. Go to the ticket counter over there

93
06:39.560 --> 06:40.820
and buy the earliest ticket.

94
06:40.820 --> 06:43.220
[Exit]

95
06:50.680 --> 06:51.270
Well,

96
06:51.270 --> 06:52.630
I want to buy a ticket to Beijing.

97
06:52.630 --> 06:53.690
Are there any left?

98
06:56.390 --> 06:57.430
Tickets in the presale period

99
06:57.430 --> 06:58.159
are all sold out.

100
06:58.159 --> 06:59.560
The earliest is in 3 days.

101
07:06.240 --> 07:06.970
I'm done for.

102
07:07.630 --> 07:08.630
What did they say?

103
07:10.240 --> 07:11.950
They said tickets within the presale period

104
07:11.950 --> 07:12.950
were all sold out.

105
07:13.040 --> 07:14.170
I have to wait 3 days.

106
07:14.270 --> 07:14.830
Yeah,

107
07:14.830 --> 07:16.490
I also saw no tickets on my app.

108
07:18.390 --> 07:20.790
See? You really have no social experience.

109
07:20.870 --> 07:22.240
You haven't even left your hometown,

110
07:22.240 --> 07:23.900
and you're already losing it.

111
07:25.360 --> 07:26.160
Stop nagging.

112
07:26.360 --> 07:28.560
I'm starting to be less confident in myself.

113
07:28.560 --> 07:29.800
Stop it.

114
07:30.560 --> 07:31.960
You only wasted a ticket.

115
07:34.070 --> 07:35.000
There's no other choice.

116
07:35.000 --> 07:36.750
You'll have to leave in a few days.

117
07:36.750 --> 07:37.390
Go home first.

118
07:37.390 --> 07:38.390
I'm going to work.

119
07:42.390 --> 07:44.190
You... You told me to find

120
07:44.390 --> 07:45.190
another job

121
07:45.190 --> 07:46.390
in Fucheng last time.

122
07:46.830 --> 07:48.690
What kind of job should I look for?

123
07:49.430 --> 07:51.600
This family is from Liaozhong.

124
07:51.870 --> 07:53.159
It's a custom back in their hometown

125
07:53.159 --> 07:54.310
to cry and circle the coffin 18 times.

126
07:54.310 --> 07:55.360
Can you arrange it?

127
07:55.360 --> 07:56.680
Why not?

128
07:56.870 --> 07:58.530
We have to follow their rules.

129
08:07.870 --> 08:09.240
Didn't Zhengguang go to Beijing?

130
08:09.240 --> 08:09.950
Why is his ID card

131
08:09.950 --> 08:10.920
here with you?

132
08:11.510 --> 08:12.560
Well...

133
08:12.750 --> 08:14.210
He said he was not in a hurry

134
08:14.480 --> 08:15.430
and would leave in a few days.

135
08:15.430 --> 08:16.630
Let's l-load the car.

136
08:16.830 --> 08:17.390
Hurry up.

137
08:18.480 --> 08:19.540
That's all, right?

138
08:19.630 --> 08:20.310
Yeah.

139
08:20.310 --> 08:20.870
Let's go!

140
08:21.920 --> 08:22.870
Stop scrolling on your phone.

141
08:22.870 --> 08:23.680
Mind your step.

142
08:23.680 --> 08:24.870
You're so bossy.

143
08:40.750 --> 08:41.549
Mr. Long.

144
08:44.270 --> 08:45.080
It's fine.

145
08:50.320 --> 08:52.870
You want to be a gofer at our hospital?

146
08:53.670 --> 08:54.080
Yep.

147
08:54.510 --> 08:57.030
I don't need a formal position. Pay me whatever you see fit.

148
08:57.030 --> 08:57.510
I don't need

149
08:57.510 --> 08:59.570
to give you a gift for this job, right?

150
09:01.240 --> 09:03.240
We'll talk about it after it's done.

151
09:09.440 --> 09:11.360
But you have to tell me why.

152
09:12.630 --> 09:14.200
You don't actually like mopping floors

153
09:14.200 --> 09:15.860
and cleaning toilets, do you?

154
09:16.120 --> 09:17.670
I just want to find him a job

155
09:17.670 --> 09:19.120
that he can do

156
09:19.240 --> 09:20.630
to support himself.

157
09:20.630 --> 09:21.790
Let me speak for myself.

158
09:21.790 --> 09:22.600
Mr. Long,

159
09:22.790 --> 09:24.480
I can do any dirty or drudgery work.

160
09:24.480 --> 09:25.720
I just want to see

161
09:25.720 --> 09:27.750
how well I can handle stress.

162
09:31.870 --> 09:34.000
I actually have a better place for you.

163
09:39.220 --> 09:40.590
[Emergency Surgery Department]

164
09:40.590 --> 09:45.220
[Gastric Lavage Room]

165
09:52.890 --> 09:55.770
[Storage]

166
10:05.400 --> 10:07.750
[Quiet]

167
10:33.080 --> 10:34.410
Hello, President Long.

168
10:34.790 --> 10:36.320
What brings you here today?

169
10:39.080 --> 10:40.120
Is Mr. Wu here?

170
10:40.630 --> 10:41.690
Mr. Wu is upstairs.

171
10:41.720 --> 10:43.520
Do you need me to show you the way?

172
10:44.150 --> 10:44.840
No, thanks.

173
10:45.030 --> 10:45.670
Alright.

174
10:55.440 --> 10:56.570
Hi, President Long.

175
10:58.120 --> 10:59.050
Hello, Mr. Long!

176
11:01.750 --> 11:02.680
President Long.

177
11:17.360 --> 11:18.290
President Long.

178
11:23.680 --> 11:31.990
[Flower of Wealth]

179
11:49.840 --> 11:52.030
Man, you're pretty muscular.

180
11:53.270 --> 11:55.070
Alright, come to work tomorrow.

181
11:55.240 --> 11:56.240
The base salary is 3,000 yuan.

182
11:56.240 --> 11:57.270
And if you do well,

183
11:57.270 --> 11:58.480
your bonus can exceed 10,000 yuan.

184
11:58.480 --> 11:59.120
How's it?

185
11:59.120 --> 11:59.870
That much?

186
12:00.240 --> 12:02.570
Maybe I didn't make myself clear just now.

187
12:03.510 --> 12:04.670
He'll only work as a waiter

188
12:04.670 --> 12:05.630
for 10 days,

189
12:05.720 --> 12:06.630
like an intern.

190
12:06.750 --> 12:08.600
Hey, Big Brother, are you kidding me?

191
12:08.600 --> 12:10.550
Who does an internship at KTV?

192
12:11.630 --> 12:14.000
Zhengliang is the junior I value the most.

193
12:15.720 --> 12:17.000
Zhengguang is his little brother,

194
12:17.000 --> 12:18.530
who's never suffered much.

195
12:19.000 --> 12:20.730
It's just for him to toughen up.

196
12:22.360 --> 12:24.390
Just... for him to toughen up?

197
12:27.360 --> 12:28.080
Alright, Big Brother,

198
12:28.080 --> 12:29.210
let's do as you said.

199
12:30.320 --> 12:32.250
It's just a waste of his potential.

200
12:33.960 --> 12:34.750
Jie,

201
12:34.790 --> 12:35.790
come to my office.

202
12:38.960 --> 12:40.420
He's your little brother?

203
12:42.150 --> 12:43.240
May I have your surname?

204
12:43.240 --> 12:44.030
Liu.

205
12:44.600 --> 12:45.390
Well,

206
12:46.240 --> 12:48.120
Dr. Liu, which department

207
12:48.120 --> 12:49.840
in the hospital are you the chief physician of?

208
12:49.840 --> 12:53.240
The associate one of the Emergency and Neurosurgical Depts.

209
12:55.000 --> 12:56.200
Young and promising.

210
13:01.510 --> 13:03.000
Boss, what's up? Are we going to war?

211
13:03.000 --> 13:04.030
Our men are ready!

212
13:04.320 --> 13:06.080
What... What war?

213
13:06.080 --> 13:07.080
W-Who are we going to fight?

214
13:07.080 --> 13:08.940
What... What do you mean by "war"?

215
13:09.200 --> 13:10.840
W-We've got guests here!

216
13:10.840 --> 13:12.510
What... What are you doing?

217
13:13.200 --> 13:14.480
Mind your manners.

218
13:15.870 --> 13:16.670
Um...

219
13:18.510 --> 13:19.840
W-What's your name again?

220
13:19.840 --> 13:20.510
Zhengguang.

221
13:20.510 --> 13:21.910
Right, yes, Zhengguang.

222
13:22.200 --> 13:24.360
He's Chief Physician Liu's little brother.

223
13:24.360 --> 13:25.790
Big Brother Long introduced him here.

224
13:25.790 --> 13:26.670
He'll be interning here

225
13:26.670 --> 13:27.320
for just 10 days.

226
13:27.320 --> 13:28.320
You'll guide him.

227
13:29.480 --> 13:29.960
Okay.

228
13:30.510 --> 13:31.320
Come with me!

229
13:32.360 --> 13:34.090
-Where am I going? -Go with him.

230
13:34.720 --> 13:35.510
Wait.

231
13:36.390 --> 13:37.200
President.

232
13:37.960 --> 13:38.840
Don't worry.

233
13:39.150 --> 13:39.960
Go.

234
13:40.120 --> 13:40.910
No worries.

235
13:41.200 --> 13:42.320
It's fine.

236
13:43.750 --> 13:44.550
Big Brother.

237
13:45.120 --> 13:45.910
Well...

238
13:47.670 --> 13:49.750
Um, can I discuss something with you?

239
13:50.320 --> 13:51.600
Business has been

240
13:51.600 --> 13:54.030
really rough lately.

241
13:55.000 --> 13:56.670
Well, Big Brother, could you give me

242
13:56.670 --> 13:57.670
a little more time

243
13:57.670 --> 13:59.800
to pay this quarter's protection fee?

244
14:01.080 --> 14:02.280
Please, Big Brother.

245
14:03.390 --> 14:04.200
Big Brother.

246
14:04.960 --> 14:05.750
No.

247
14:13.480 --> 14:14.680
Come on, Big Brother.

248
14:15.390 --> 14:16.070
Be gentle.

249
14:16.070 --> 14:16.630
Something's

250
14:16.630 --> 14:17.600
wrong with my brain, you know?

251
14:17.600 --> 14:18.660
Be gentle, please.

252
14:25.790 --> 14:26.650
Come back here.

253
14:33.840 --> 14:35.100
Take off your clothes.

254
14:35.550 --> 14:38.120
Bro, why do I need to take off my clothes?

255
14:43.910 --> 14:45.360
To change into your uniform.

256
14:45.360 --> 14:46.790
What are you afraid of?

257
14:48.670 --> 14:50.600
We run a legitimate business here.

258
14:50.750 --> 14:52.120
I just heard the boss say

259
14:52.320 --> 14:54.550
the bonus could be over 10,000 yuan if I do well.

260
14:54.550 --> 14:57.080
It doesn't sound like a legitimate business.

261
14:57.480 --> 14:58.670
Mr. Wu meant for you

262
14:58.670 --> 14:59.960
to be his assistant.

263
15:01.240 --> 15:02.630
He has a special hobby.

264
15:03.390 --> 15:04.840
You'll find out later.

265
15:14.360 --> 15:15.440
Mr. Wu...

266
15:15.440 --> 15:16.500
Mr. Wu is a good guy.

267
15:16.960 --> 15:18.390
He just has a quirk.

268
15:17.160 --> 15:20.530
[Quiet]

269
15:18.390 --> 15:19.850
He likes to play gangster.

270
15:20.630 --> 15:21.270
He's hired a few

271
15:21.270 --> 15:22.930
young guys of similar height.

272
15:23.150 --> 15:24.480
They do nothing

273
15:24.630 --> 15:25.550
but wear black suits

274
15:25.550 --> 15:27.080
and wander around with him.

275
15:27.790 --> 15:28.870
Half the money he makes

276
15:28.870 --> 15:30.530
is spent on the show he puts on.

277
15:33.270 --> 15:34.080
And he insists on calling

278
15:34.080 --> 15:36.080
the rent I collect a protection fee.

279
15:36.720 --> 15:38.360
He's just watched too many gangster movies

280
15:38.360 --> 15:39.490
and got influenced.

281
15:40.200 --> 15:41.270
Then just now, that...

282
15:41.270 --> 15:44.000
That manager talked about going to war and something.

283
15:44.000 --> 15:44.840
A price war.

284
15:45.600 --> 15:47.480
Twenty-eight yuan for 3 hours of singing,

285
15:47.480 --> 15:48.790
with free beer and popcorn.

286
15:48.790 --> 15:49.670
This is insane.

287
15:51.240 --> 15:52.900
That's really an eye-opener.

288
15:53.320 --> 15:54.320
A certain environment

289
15:53.960 --> 15:56.080
[Passage Only for Medical Staff]

290
15:54.320 --> 15:55.270
raises a certain kind of people.

291
15:55.270 --> 15:56.790
You can't blame it on the environment.

292
15:56.790 --> 15:59.080
You won't find another place like this in Fucheng.

293
15:59.080 --> 16:00.120
I'm going to work.

294
16:03.670 --> 16:04.510
I did you a favor.

295
16:04.510 --> 16:06.510
Aren't you going to return one to me?

296
16:07.840 --> 16:10.080
You didn't say there were conditions beforehand.

297
16:10.080 --> 16:11.030
Don't be nervous.

298
16:11.030 --> 16:12.760
It has something to do with you.

299
16:13.320 --> 16:14.200
Go to Daoxi Photo Studio

300
16:14.200 --> 16:15.600
and take several photos.

301
16:15.670 --> 16:16.730
What? Take photos?

302
16:17.120 --> 16:17.910
For what?

303
16:18.120 --> 16:19.750
To update the hospital's promotional materials.

304
16:19.750 --> 16:22.280
Everyone above deputy senior has taken them.

305
16:25.550 --> 16:26.080
This is enough.

306
16:26.080 --> 16:27.280
You're taking it now?

307
16:28.120 --> 16:29.580
Check the lighting first.

308
16:31.200 --> 16:32.240
Stay still. Keep your head up.

309
16:32.240 --> 16:33.440
Look straight ahead.

310
16:36.360 --> 16:37.440
You look way too serious.

311
16:37.440 --> 16:38.720
Give me a smile.

312
16:41.000 --> 16:41.750
This is too fake.

313
16:41.750 --> 16:42.600
Smile.

314
16:42.720 --> 16:44.670
Take your hands out of your pockets.

315
16:44.670 --> 16:45.840
Think of a pose.

316
16:46.030 --> 16:47.000
How about this?

317
16:47.550 --> 16:48.440
Or this?

318
16:49.320 --> 16:50.080
Better put them down.

319
16:50.080 --> 16:51.600
Better put your hands down.

320
16:51.600 --> 16:52.440
Just do this.

321
16:52.600 --> 16:53.600
Relax a bit.

322
16:56.720 --> 16:59.080
The whole lighting is a bit too white.

323
16:59.750 --> 17:00.410
Give him...

324
17:08.160 --> 17:08.829
Hello.

325
17:26.069 --> 17:26.880
San.

326
17:27.880 --> 17:28.740
Come over here.

327
17:30.350 --> 17:31.350
They're all here.

328
17:34.270 --> 17:35.030
Take this.

329
17:35.110 --> 17:36.510
Alright, this is enough.

330
17:37.750 --> 17:38.750
Where's your mom?

331
17:39.000 --> 17:40.130
In the back, I guess.

332
17:41.920 --> 17:43.640
-It‘s 78.4 yuan in total. -Amy.

333
17:43.640 --> 17:44.790
I paid for this one back there inside.

334
17:44.790 --> 17:45.350
-Yes. -Let's go.

335
17:45.350 --> 17:46.310
That'll be 78 yuan, please.

336
17:46.310 --> 17:47.110
Okay.

337
17:48.240 --> 17:48.720
Mom.

338
17:48.880 --> 17:49.480
Let me carry it.

339
17:49.480 --> 17:50.280
Where to scan?

340
17:50.510 --> 17:51.160
Oh, over there.

341
17:51.160 --> 17:52.090
J-Just a minute.

342
17:53.680 --> 17:54.480
There we go.

343
17:55.240 --> 17:55.880
Just a second.

344
17:55.880 --> 17:56.830
Let me pay.

345
17:57.200 --> 17:58.240
Received 100 yuan. Let me give you change.

346
17:58.240 --> 17:59.570
We paid you in cash, huh?

347
18:00.440 --> 18:01.640
I haven't given you change yet.

348
18:01.640 --> 18:02.400
Let me give you change.

349
18:02.400 --> 18:03.110
No, no need.

350
18:13.720 --> 18:14.510
Amy.

351
18:15.350 --> 18:17.480
I want to talk to you about something.

352
18:19.830 --> 18:22.880
[1314 Funeral Services]

353
18:20.680 --> 18:21.550
Well,

354
18:21.680 --> 18:22.590
can we

355
18:23.070 --> 18:25.200
not grab other people's things again?

356
18:26.510 --> 18:27.960
Tell me what you like,

357
18:27.960 --> 18:29.640
and I'll buy it for you, okay?

358
18:34.680 --> 18:35.720
What do you mean?

359
18:38.590 --> 18:40.000
You think I'm embarrassing, don't you?

360
18:40.000 --> 18:42.130
I've been like this since I was little.

361
18:42.880 --> 18:44.440
When you met me,

362
18:44.440 --> 18:46.270
you knew I liked...

363
18:46.960 --> 18:48.160
to grab things.

364
18:48.310 --> 18:50.240
I didn't see you run away back then.

365
18:50.590 --> 18:51.590
When I was young,

366
18:51.590 --> 18:52.680
y-you made me

367
18:52.680 --> 18:54.110
lose my mind.

368
18:55.830 --> 18:57.000
As the saying goes,

369
18:57.200 --> 18:59.200
love makes people lose their minds.

370
18:59.720 --> 19:01.270
I loved you so much that...

371
19:01.880 --> 19:03.480
I... I totally lost my mind.

372
19:03.790 --> 19:04.790
The more you say, the wilder you get.

373
19:04.790 --> 19:05.790
How dare you pick on me?

374
19:05.790 --> 19:07.390
-What's wrong with me? -Amy.

375
19:09.200 --> 19:11.310
We can cure the problem.

376
19:11.310 --> 19:12.510
What's there to cure?

377
19:12.680 --> 19:13.790
Cure yourself.

378
19:14.030 --> 19:14.880
I'm not sick.

379
19:19.230 --> 19:21.800
[1314 Funeral Services]

380
19:24.110 --> 19:26.030
Okay, a little to the left. To the left.

381
19:26.030 --> 19:27.430
A little more to the left.

382
19:27.750 --> 19:29.240
Alright, hang it.

383
19:32.110 --> 19:34.560
[Liu Zhengliang, Celebrity Chief Physician [Emergency Department]

384
19:34.160 --> 19:35.960
On the left, that corner on the left.

385
19:35.960 --> 19:37.160
Smooth that corner out.

386
19:37.160 --> 19:38.360
Right at that corner.

387
19:39.220 --> 19:43.210
[Liu Zhengliang, Celebrity Chief Physician [Emergency Department]

388
19:39.590 --> 19:40.440
Okay, the left is fine now.

389
19:40.440 --> 19:41.310
Now the right side.

390
19:41.310 --> 19:42.590
Smooth out that corner on the right.

391
19:42.590 --> 19:43.110
On the right.

392
19:43.110 --> 19:45.270
Look, his smile is quite cute.

393
19:45.480 --> 19:46.270
Yeah.

394
19:46.400 --> 19:47.600
He's quite handsome.

395
19:47.830 --> 19:48.890
Okay, that's good.

396
19:51.820 --> 19:55.770
[1314 Funeral Services]

397
20:07.650 --> 20:10.970
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

398
20:12.510 --> 20:13.790
Good morning, Chief Physician Liu.

399
20:13.370 --> 20:15.190
[Exit]

400
20:14.960 --> 20:15.750
Chief Physician Liu.

401
20:15.190 --> 20:17.690
[Security Duty Room]

402
20:18.790 --> 20:20.050
Good morning, Dr. Liu.

403
20:21.290 --> 20:25.190
[Treating patients with skill and compassion]

404
20:22.880 --> 20:23.680
Dr. Liu.

405
20:24.160 --> 20:24.720
You're here.

406
20:24.720 --> 20:25.480
Come in.

407
20:27.680 --> 20:28.480
Wait for me.

408
20:34.200 --> 20:34.920
Chief Physician Liu,

409
20:34.920 --> 20:36.440
I'm Chen Sheng from the Gastroenterology Department.

410
20:36.440 --> 20:37.370
Nice to meet you.

411
20:39.310 --> 20:41.510
I'm Wu from the Proctology Department.

412
20:43.750 --> 20:44.550
Who is he?

413
20:45.070 --> 20:46.030
The one who saved the patient

414
20:46.030 --> 20:47.070
with a crushed skull.

415
20:47.070 --> 20:49.730
The one whose photo is hanging on the outer wall.

416
20:50.550 --> 20:52.110
Hello, Chief Physician Liu.

417
20:52.110 --> 20:54.910
I'm Zhang from the Medical Insurance Department.

418
21:10.110 --> 21:11.570
I was just looking for you.

419
21:11.880 --> 21:13.440
You still had the guts to look for me?

420
21:13.440 --> 21:15.160
What's wrong? Did I offend you again?

421
21:15.160 --> 21:16.160
Stop pretending.

422
21:16.400 --> 21:17.400
What's going on with my photo

423
21:17.400 --> 21:18.330
at the entrance?

424
21:19.030 --> 21:20.030
It's a good thing.

425
21:21.480 --> 21:22.400
Didn't expect

426
21:22.400 --> 21:23.530
Xiaoximen Hospital

427
21:23.640 --> 21:25.200
to promote you

428
21:25.200 --> 21:26.240
so well, huh?

429
21:26.590 --> 21:28.160
It's no worse than in big cities, right?

430
21:28.160 --> 21:29.560
You call this promotion?

431
21:29.720 --> 21:30.850
What did you tell me?

432
21:30.880 --> 21:31.510
You told me that

433
21:31.510 --> 21:33.070
everyone above deputy senior took the photos.

434
21:33.070 --> 21:33.550
Why is it

435
21:33.550 --> 21:35.150
only my photo hanging there?

436
21:35.440 --> 21:37.100
Yes, they all took the photos.

437
21:37.830 --> 21:39.750
Yours was chosen from the crowd to be put on the wall.

438
21:39.750 --> 21:40.880
Why are you unhappy with it?

439
21:40.880 --> 21:42.270
Why would I be happy?

440
21:42.920 --> 21:43.920
I'll leave in at most

441
21:43.920 --> 21:44.830
a month or so.

442
21:44.830 --> 21:45.920
This is fraud.

443
21:46.590 --> 21:48.440
So what if you'll leave in a month or so?

444
21:48.440 --> 21:49.200
As everyone says,

445
21:49.200 --> 21:51.030
it takes 21 days to form a habit.

446
21:51.030 --> 21:52.070
A month is enough.

447
21:52.880 --> 21:53.720
Besides,

448
21:53.720 --> 21:55.030
in this small place,

449
21:55.680 --> 21:57.160
the locals

450
21:57.350 --> 21:58.680
take a walk 3 times a day

451
21:58.750 --> 22:00.610
and pass by Xiaoximen every time.

452
22:00.920 --> 22:02.440
Don't you think this can

453
22:02.960 --> 22:04.110
promote you well?

454
22:06.550 --> 22:08.410
You tricked me. That's one thing.

455
22:08.640 --> 22:10.720
But you're also tricking the patients?

456
22:10.720 --> 22:12.350
I'm not a chief doctor at all!

457
22:12.440 --> 22:13.970
This is false advertising.

458
22:15.480 --> 22:16.680
You're the associate chief physician

459
22:16.680 --> 22:18.160
of the Emergency and Neurosurgical Depts,

460
22:18.160 --> 22:20.960
approved unanimously by the hospital committee.

461
22:21.200 --> 22:23.110
Same work, with your title promoted by 2 ranks

462
22:23.110 --> 22:24.030
and your salary doubled.

463
22:24.030 --> 22:25.090
Happy to hear that?

464
22:25.110 --> 22:25.920
Happy...

465
22:26.550 --> 22:27.240
Why... Why would I...

466
22:27.240 --> 22:29.040
Why would I be happy? Seriously?

467
22:29.510 --> 22:30.880
Everyone is laughing at me.

468
22:30.880 --> 22:31.720
Everyone's

469
22:31.720 --> 22:33.240
just happy for you.

470
22:33.240 --> 22:35.040
What do you mean laughing at you?

471
22:36.750 --> 22:38.680
Tell me, if you were in Shenzhen,

472
22:40.160 --> 22:41.550
would there be so many people

473
22:41.550 --> 22:43.110
genuinely feeling happy for you?

474
22:43.110 --> 22:43.920
Hey...

475
22:47.200 --> 22:48.720
I... I'm telling you,

476
22:48.720 --> 22:49.510
this is...

477
22:49.880 --> 22:50.590
This is an infringement

478
22:50.590 --> 22:51.400
of my portrait rights.

479
22:51.400 --> 22:52.600
I can sue you for this!

480
22:52.680 --> 22:54.810
Go back and look through the contract.

481
22:55.400 --> 22:56.680
The portrait rights during your employment

482
22:56.680 --> 22:58.540
belong entirely to the hospital.

483
22:58.590 --> 22:59.400
I will.

484
22:59.920 --> 23:01.680
I have to look through it carefully.

485
23:01.680 --> 23:02.750
I'll read it very carefully.

486
23:02.750 --> 23:04.440
I'm going to read it right away.

487
23:04.440 --> 23:05.920
I know it's hard for you to accept

488
23:05.920 --> 23:08.050
such a massive promotional campaign.

489
23:08.480 --> 23:10.030
But why do we have to do this?

490
23:11.310 --> 23:12.510
We just don't want to hide the fact

491
23:12.510 --> 23:13.550
that Xiaoximen Hospital

492
23:13.550 --> 23:14.830
has such an excellent surgeon

493
23:14.830 --> 23:15.920
like you.

494
23:20.750 --> 23:22.150
The country trained you,

495
23:22.350 --> 23:23.550
and it's your destiny

496
23:24.160 --> 23:25.510
to shine and help as many patients

497
23:25.510 --> 23:26.640
as you can.

498
23:43.830 --> 23:44.640
Mingming.

499
23:46.720 --> 23:49.850
You graduated from our province's medical university?

500
23:50.480 --> 23:52.110
I also got my bachelor's degree there.

501
23:52.110 --> 23:53.240
What class were you?

502
23:53.830 --> 23:55.310
Class of 2011, clinical medicine.

503
23:55.310 --> 23:56.370
I was Class of 2009.

504
23:58.550 --> 24:00.680
Why do I have no impression of you?

505
24:00.790 --> 24:02.030
Do you know me?

506
24:03.590 --> 24:04.480
I know you.

507
24:05.430 --> 24:06.680
I only focused on studying,

508
24:06.680 --> 24:07.480
unlike you,

509
24:07.920 --> 24:08.720
who was in the student union

510
24:08.720 --> 24:09.640
and even formed a band,

511
24:09.640 --> 24:10.770
always showing off.

512
24:11.030 --> 24:12.760
You have some impression of me.

513
24:15.960 --> 24:17.480
Big star, Chief Physician Liu,

514
24:17.480 --> 24:18.340
what happened?

515
24:22.200 --> 24:23.000
What's wrong?

516
24:30.750 --> 24:33.000
There really is a portrait rights clause.

517
24:33.000 --> 24:34.790
What a cunning old man.

518
24:36.000 --> 24:37.530
You got tricked by Mr. Long?

519
24:38.160 --> 24:39.290
Then trick him back.

520
24:40.720 --> 24:41.510
No way.

521
24:41.830 --> 24:43.480
I've got to check in on Zhang Jiao.

522
24:43.480 --> 24:44.510
If she doesn't wake up soon,

523
24:44.510 --> 24:45.110
who knows what

524
24:45.110 --> 24:47.110
other dirty tricks are awaiting me.

525
24:47.270 --> 24:48.240
Do you need my help?

526
24:48.240 --> 24:49.300
Just eat your food.

527
24:52.200 --> 24:53.000
Mingming,

528
24:53.440 --> 24:55.770
do you remember what my signature song was

529
24:56.160 --> 24:57.960
when I was in school?

530
24:59.920 --> 25:00.680
"Too Softhearted."

531
25:00.680 --> 25:02.310
And also "Sad Pacific."

532
25:03.920 --> 25:05.000
I've heard them all,

533
25:05.000 --> 25:06.200
but I don't like them.

534
25:08.550 --> 25:10.200
I can sing English songs, too.

535
25:10.200 --> 25:11.530
"Take Me to Your Heart."

536
25:15.200 --> 25:16.800
My spoken English is not bad.

537
25:17.400 --> 25:18.930
Let me know if you need help.

538
25:23.370 --> 25:24.370
[KTV Flower of Wealth]

539
25:28.720 --> 25:29.510
Come in.

540
25:32.310 --> 25:33.270
Come here, young man.

541
25:33.270 --> 25:34.870
Come sing with me for a while.

542
25:36.000 --> 25:36.790
What?

543
25:39.240 --> 25:41.400
My husband passed away half a year ago,

544
25:41.920 --> 25:43.980
right at Xiaoximen Hospital nearby.

545
25:45.160 --> 25:47.220
I've been dreaming about him lately.

546
25:47.790 --> 25:49.640
I dare not stay alone anymore.

547
25:49.880 --> 25:51.270
I've got a heart condition.

548
25:51.270 --> 25:52.030
I'm scared.

549
25:52.640 --> 25:53.790
Madam, you should see a doctor

550
25:53.790 --> 25:55.160
at the hospital for your heart condition.

551
25:55.160 --> 25:56.480
Why are you turning to me?

552
25:56.480 --> 25:57.350
No doctor.

553
25:57.350 --> 25:58.480
I don't like any doctor. Come with me.

554
25:58.480 --> 25:59.550
I just like you.

555
25:59.750 --> 26:00.480
Come on,

556
26:00.480 --> 26:01.680
just sing with me for a while.

557
26:01.680 --> 26:02.640
What's the big deal?

558
26:02.640 --> 26:03.720
Just for a while, okay?

559
26:03.720 --> 26:04.400
You just...

560
26:04.400 --> 26:05.590
You look exactly like my husband

561
26:05.590 --> 26:06.790
when he was young.

562
26:07.000 --> 26:08.350
Just think of it as helping me

563
26:08.350 --> 26:10.350
make up for my regrets from my youth,

564
26:10.350 --> 26:11.110
okay?

565
26:40.850 --> 26:43.810
[Xiaoximen Hospital, the guardian of your health]

566
26:53.590 --> 26:55.270
Your condition is related to stress.

567
26:55.270 --> 27:01.060
[Wishing You a Speedy Recovery]

568
26:55.390 --> 26:56.720
Please stay calm.

569
26:56.720 --> 26:57.400
Try not to get upset

570
26:57.400 --> 26:58.110
with your family, huh?

571
26:58.110 --> 26:58.550
Okay.

572
26:58.550 --> 26:59.070
Be careful.

573
26:59.070 --> 26:59.960
Be careful when you walk.

574
26:59.960 --> 27:00.960
When will Chief Physician Liu come?

575
27:00.960 --> 27:01.750
You have to wait a while.

576
27:01.750 --> 27:03.000
How about you wait outside first?

577
27:03.000 --> 27:03.550
Huh?

578
27:03.550 --> 27:04.310
Be patient.

579
27:04.310 --> 27:04.960
I'll tell you when he comes.

580
27:04.960 --> 27:05.640
Please take a look

581
27:05.640 --> 27:06.350
at my mom's X-ray and see

582
27:06.350 --> 27:07.160
if there's a big problem.

583
27:07.160 --> 27:07.830
Your mom's...

584
27:07.830 --> 27:08.920
Chief Physician Liu is here.

585
27:08.920 --> 27:10.120
Chief Physician Liu?

586
27:13.440 --> 27:14.400
No pushing.

587
27:14.510 --> 27:15.440
Line up at the clinic!

588
27:15.440 --> 27:16.310
Line up!

589
27:17.030 --> 27:19.110
Chief Physician Liu, check out the X-ray.

590
27:19.110 --> 27:20.160
Dr. Liu, look at this X-ray.

591
27:20.160 --> 27:23.350
-Dr. Liu, Dr. Liu. -Dr. Liu.

592
27:31.680 --> 27:32.400
Go, go...

593
27:32.400 --> 27:33.480
What's going on?

594
27:33.480 --> 27:34.830
They are all here for you!

595
27:34.830 --> 27:35.680
For you!

596
27:35.750 --> 27:36.590
They're here for me?

597
27:36.590 --> 27:37.450
Go, go in first.

598
27:39.070 --> 27:39.790
Chief Physician Liu's here.

599
27:39.790 --> 27:41.000
Hello, Chief Physician Liu.

600
27:41.000 --> 27:41.750
Did you come all the way here

601
27:41.750 --> 27:43.400
surrounded by people?

602
27:43.590 --> 27:44.880
There are so many people out there

603
27:44.880 --> 27:46.270
in bunches,

604
27:46.310 --> 27:47.000
right?

605
27:47.000 --> 27:48.480
From morning till now,

606
27:48.480 --> 27:49.720
it's been 1 person every 10 seconds,

607
27:49.720 --> 27:50.590
one after another,

608
27:50.590 --> 27:51.920
knocking on the door and asking if you are here.

609
27:51.920 --> 27:52.480
This is crazy.

610
27:52.480 --> 27:54.270
Wait... What's this all about?

611
27:54.750 --> 27:57.110
Is it because of that big advertisement outside?

612
27:57.110 --> 27:58.070
You don't know?

613
27:58.070 --> 27:59.470
-What do you mean? -Look.

614
27:59.590 --> 28:01.250
The poster is well-designed.

615
28:01.820 --> 28:02.390
[Liu Zhengliang, Associate Chief Physician of Emergency and Neurosurgical Departments]

616
28:02.410 --> 28:03.470
[To celebrate Chief Physician Liu's appointment, Xiaoximen is offering]

617
28:03.500 --> 28:05.000
[90% off registration fees in the Emergency and Neurosurgical Departments this month.]

618
28:06.200 --> 28:07.070
This old geezer

619
28:07.070 --> 28:08.730
really has more dirty tricks.

620
28:09.160 --> 28:10.240
Is he crazy,

621
28:10.400 --> 28:12.110
making the hospital a hypermarket?

622
28:12.110 --> 28:13.310
Is this even allowed?

623
28:13.830 --> 28:15.880
We filed the paperwork for it as a free clinic

624
28:15.880 --> 28:16.880
half a month beforehand.

625
28:16.880 --> 28:18.310
It's fine even without paperwork.

626
28:18.310 --> 28:19.160
Rules are rigid,

627
28:19.160 --> 28:20.350
yet leaders are flexible.

628
28:20.350 --> 28:20.720
Exactly,

629
28:20.720 --> 28:21.590
that flexible leader,

630
28:21.590 --> 28:24.050
Director Sun, is President Long's student.

631
28:26.640 --> 28:27.640
I got it.

632
28:28.310 --> 28:29.680
He wants to make the most of me

633
28:29.680 --> 28:30.810
as fast as possible.

634
28:34.640 --> 28:35.500
Long Dongdong.

635
28:35.640 --> 28:36.400
Calm down!

636
28:36.400 --> 28:36.830
Where are you going?

637
28:36.830 --> 28:37.350
Zhengliang!

638
28:37.350 --> 28:38.510
Are you going to fight the President?

639
28:38.510 --> 28:39.640
Where are you going?

640
28:42.070 --> 28:44.550
The President doesn't seem to be in his office.

641
28:44.550 --> 28:45.480
-Chief Physician Liu! -Chief Physician Liu!

642
28:45.480 --> 28:46.590
Make way, please!

643
28:47.480 --> 28:48.880
Make way! Let him out!

644
28:48.880 --> 28:50.080
Don't block the door!

645
28:56.110 --> 28:57.030
Where is the President?

646
28:57.030 --> 28:57.550
He's too popular.

647
28:57.550 --> 28:58.950
Come on, open your mouth.

648
29:04.960 --> 29:05.750
Okay.

649
29:06.270 --> 29:07.000
Your condition

650
29:07.000 --> 29:08.000
is no big problem.

651
29:08.160 --> 29:09.790
Just some red swelling on the pharyngeal wall.

652
29:09.790 --> 29:11.320
It's chronic pharyngitis.

653
29:11.590 --> 29:12.200
Usually,

654
29:12.200 --> 29:14.000
you can use the boat-fruited sterculia seed

655
29:14.000 --> 29:14.680
to make tea and drink it.

656
29:14.680 --> 29:15.210
Let's go.

657
29:15.310 --> 29:16.590
Stick to a light diet,

658
29:16.640 --> 29:17.790
take care of your throat,

659
29:17.790 --> 29:19.400
and take some throat lozenges.

660
29:19.400 --> 29:20.030
Okay.

661
29:20.270 --> 29:21.270
Thank you, Dr. Liu.

662
29:21.270 --> 29:21.880
It's okay.

663
29:23.440 --> 29:24.720
He's seeing patients now?

664
29:24.720 --> 29:26.400
He was just blowing his top,

665
29:27.000 --> 29:28.750
and now he's seeing patients?

666
29:29.030 --> 29:30.070
That's just how he is.

667
29:30.070 --> 29:31.130
He blows up easily.

668
29:31.310 --> 29:32.830
But after that, he works even harder.

669
29:32.830 --> 29:35.560
A typical competitive, confident personality.

670
29:36.400 --> 29:38.130
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

671
29:39.160 --> 29:39.920
So you two

