956
41:19.510 --> 41:20.440
Liu Zhengliang.

957
41:21.840 --> 41:23.190
Tell Mr. Long that

958
41:23.230 --> 41:24.400
I don't want to work at KTV anymore.

959
41:24.400 --> 41:25.070
